  "text": "This outfit honors your request for a simple and restrained look fitting for the morning of the funeral. The deep blue suit offers a clean, solid silhouette that respects the solemnity of the occasion while maintaining dignity and poise. Its classic cut provides structure without being overly ornate, allowing you to focus on presence rather than fashion. The black pumps, Dakota bag, and brown leather belt complete the ensemble with quiet sophistication, grounding the look in timeless elegance.",
