      "n": "#483·36",
      "text": "The navy blue suit features a tailored jacket with notched lapels and flap pockets, paired with straight-leg trousers that fall to the ankle. The fabric is smooth and structured for a polished look."
    },
    {
      "n": "#500·07",
      "text": "This black satchel bag has a soft slouchy silhouette with a wide leather strap across the front secured by a silver buckle. Its rounded shape offers practical space while maintaining understated style."
    },
    {
      "n": "#337·38",
      "text": "The brown leather belt features a minimalist metal buckle and adjustable holes, designed to cinch at the waist with a clean finish that complements both casual and formal attire."
    },
    {
      "n": "#62·39",
      "text": "These black pumps have a classic pointed toe and a sturdy block heel. The interior lining is a subtle burgundy shade, adding a touch of warmth beneath the sleek exterior."
    }
